            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare i confronti per verificare se una stringa è uguale o diversa da un'altra stringa.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;online&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"&quot;online&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;online&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" != \" /><text value=\"&quot;offline&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"True\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Equality operator",
            "id": 76781,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per verificare se una stringa è uguale a un'altra stringa, usiamo anche l'<strong>operatore di uguaglianza</strong>, <code>==</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per verificare se una stringa è uguale a un'altra stringa, usiamo l'<strong>operatore di uguaglianza</strong>.</p><p>Confronta le due stringhe in modo che il codice stampi <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "True",
            "id": 76772,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se la stringa a sinistra è uguale alla stringa a destra, come in <code>\"apple\" == \"apple\"</code>, il risultato è <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"apple\"</code>, seguito da <code>==</code> e infine <code>\"apple\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Due stringhe sono uguali quando contengono esattamente lo stesso testo.</p><p>Riempi gli spazi vuoti in modo che il confronto stampi <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;orange&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;apples&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"apple\"</code>, seguito da <code>==</code> e infine <code>\"apple\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "False",
            "id": 76771,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se la stringa a sinistra non è uguale alla stringa a destra, come in <code>\"apple\" == \"orange\"</code>, il risultato è <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"&quot;orange&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>==</code>, seguito da <code>\"orange\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando due stringhe sono diverse, verificare se sono uguali restituisce <code>False</code>.</p><p>Confronta <code>\"apple\"</code> con un frutto diverso in modo che il codice stampi <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"&quot;orange&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>==</code>, seguito da <code>\"orange\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Comparing the same string",
            "id": 76782,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo anche confrontare tra loro le variabili che memorizzano stringhe, come in <code>fruit_1 == fruit_2</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"fruit_1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"fruit_2 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;orange&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(fruit_1 == fruit_2)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"63\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>fruit_1</code>, seguito da <code>==</code> e infine <code>fruit_2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo anche confrontare due variabili che memorizzano stringhe, come in <code>fruit_1 == fruit_2</code>.</p><p>Confronta le variabili dei frutti con <code>fruit_1</code> a sinistra, affinché il codice stampi <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"fruit_1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"fruit_2 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;orange&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(fruit_1 == fruit_2)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"fruit_3\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>fruit_1</code>, seguito da <code>==</code> e infine <code>fruit_2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
