            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa viene visualizzato nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;LED+&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"&quot;LED&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>False</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>True</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>False</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'output mostrato è relativo a <code>\"LED+\" == \"LED\"</code>.</p><p>Se modifichi la stringa a destra in <code>\"LED+\"</code>, cosa visualizza il codice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;LED+&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"&quot;LED&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>True</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>False</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"LED+\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>True</code>.</p></body></html>",
