            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale di questi confronti restituisce <code>True</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"apple\" == \"apple\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"apple\" == \"orange\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"apple\" == \"apple\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un confronto con <code>==</code> deve restituire <code>True</code>. Quale confronto lo fa?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"apple\" == \"apple\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"apple\" == \"orange\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"apple\" = \"apple\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"apple\" == \"apple\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
