          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 76790,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Verifica se <code>my_answer</code> è uguale a <code>solution</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"my_answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;act&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"solution  = \" /><text value=\"&quot;ace&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(my_answer == solution)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le parole <code>\"act\"</code> e <code>\"ace\"</code> sono quasi uguali, ma non sono identiche.</p><p>Confronta <code>my_answer</code> con <code>solution</code> in modo che il codice stampi <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"my_answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;act&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"solution  = \" /><text value=\"&quot;ace&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(my_answer == solution)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 2",
            "id": 76776,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Memorizza la stringa <code>\"high\"</code> in <code>my_answer</code> in modo che il confronto restituisca <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"my_answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;high&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"solution = \" /><text value=\"&quot;low&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(my_answer == solution)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;low&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"high\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un confronto restituisce <code>False</code> solo quando le due stringhe non sono uguali.</p><p>Memorizza <code>\"high\"</code> in <code>my_answer</code> e confrontalo in modo che il codice stampi <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"my_answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;high&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"solution = \" /><text value=\"&quot;low&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(my_answer == solution)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;low&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"high\"</code>, seguito da <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
